# Optional live-data and media publishing integrations. The site builds and
# runs without any of these values.

# --- Spotify (Listening tile) ---------------------------------------------
# Create an app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard, then run the
# Authorization Code flow once (scopes: user-read-currently-playing
# user-read-recently-played user-top-read) to obtain a long-lived refresh token.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=
SPOTIFY_REFRESH_TOKEN=

# --- In SF tile ------------------------------------------------------------
# No configuration needed — weather + air quality come from Open-Meteo, which
# requires no API key.

# --- Cloudinary image delivery + publishing -------------------------------
# The cloud name is public and used by the browser URL builder. API credentials
# are needed only by `npm run log:publish` and must never be exposed publicly.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=

# --- Mux video publishing --------------------------------------------------
# Playback IDs are public; these credentials are used only by log:publish.
MUX_TOKEN_ID=
MUX_TOKEN_SECRET=
